Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:05.23,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Everyone back in Ikajima Town, are you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.86,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,The weather in Tokyo has been so warm lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.75,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,you don't even need a jacket on most days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:17.59,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,With the midterms coming up soon, \Neveryone at school's studying hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:20.56,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,As you'd expect from \Nan elite prep school in Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:23.55,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,the students are hard workers \Nand competitive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:26.15,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,which keeps me on my toes every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:29.75,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That's right... They're hard workers, \Nand they're very competitive.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.09,Default,KOSHINO,0,0,0,,That decides our rosters for each sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:37.02,DefaultTop,KOSHINO,0,0,0,,School only runs half the day during exams, but \Nwe're not allowed to practice after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:40.43,DefaultTop,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,So team practice sessions will \Nhave to wait until after exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:43.94,Default,KOSHINO,0,0,0,,That doesn't leave us much time, \Nbut let's do as much as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:48.11,Default,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Also, this part is a request \Nfrom me personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:52.11,Default,MOTOBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I want us to be in it to win the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:57.07,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,Yeah, we need an overall objective \Non top of goals for each event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:01:00.12,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,We'll want to release all \Nthat pent-up exam stress, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:04.12,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Why don't we show a united front, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.83,0:01:07.20,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,We can start the weekend after exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.23,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,Aim for the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:10.57,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.75,Default,CLASS,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:17.29,DefaultTop,KAWANO,0,0,0,,If you play a sport, please take \Nthe reins and set up a practice menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:16.57,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do people here really get \Nthis amped up over events?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.96,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Me? Table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:55.77,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I don't want the slightest possibility \Nof messing up in a team sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:58.79,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I can't believe you two picked volleyball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:03.25,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,What's the point of making us compete in \Nstuff that won't affect our entrance exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:05.83,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,To hell with the insecurities \Nof the unathletic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:08.75,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,It's all machismo-driven mumbo-jumbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.09,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Makocchan...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:14.77,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,People like her, who'd lead the unhealthiest \Nlifestyle without school sports,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:17.13,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,are the ones who need this the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:23.14,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But honestly, someone had to \Nsay it, and I'm glad she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:26.30,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,That's uncharacteristically \Npessimistic, coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:31.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This might surprise you, but the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:34.42,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm terrible at sports!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.36,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Uh huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.91,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I've somehow kept it under wraps so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:42.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,but I'm a class officer! \NI can't destroy our morale by sucking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:46.17,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Whew... That should do it... \Nfor an easy, casual jog...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.74,FlashbackItalics,MAKOTOYUZUKI,0,0,0,,So slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.37,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.58,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wanna put in some individual practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:53.89,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I can help you during lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:55.14,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You will?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:57.05,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,But wait, volleyball, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:59.22,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Have any of the other girls played?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:01.73,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Why don't you try asking \None of them for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:03.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.24,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Your butt's sticking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:09.36,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I said lower your hips, not stick \Nyour butt out. Big difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:13.56,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You can't stop the ball's momentum unless \Nyou relax and keep your body flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.00,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:15.77,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.61,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Your feet are all wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:20.78,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,How did I get roped into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:23.93,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Man, the restroom's \Npretty far from here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:26.65,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Okay, you're doing better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.43,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Let's try another receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:30.40,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:33.71,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're in for an uphill battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:36.86,Default,MITSUKI,0,0,0,,Sorry... I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.65,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone has their \Nstrengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:42.67,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You can tutor me in \Nclassic literature in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:46.09,Default,MITSUKI,0,0,0,,Of course! Ask me anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:49.72,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,How about you, Egashira-san? \NAre you bad in any subjects?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:53.14,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I could stand to improve my math, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:57.42,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,But then again, I could get used to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:05:00.22,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,As a treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:23.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Here, for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.54,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wow, you didn't have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:30.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You're helping me out, \Nso Nao-cha— I mean, my aunt insisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:32.14,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:33.77,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Urk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.00,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,It's all sweet junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:39.63,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm good with just this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:41.92,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,We can share the rest in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You sure you don't want the bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:47.31,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I mean, your lunches all look like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:48.64,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,A girly girl's lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:50.57,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm not a big eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:54.45,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm controlling myself because \NI gain weight easily, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:59.85,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Bet it was a culture shock \Nfor the guys who got school lunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:04.02,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Surprised me, too. Everyone has \Nbig appetites where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:05.17,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,He's still an enigma,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.17,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:05.75,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.97,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What sides do you like in your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:09.05,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,but it looks like Shima-kun \Nreally is a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:09.05,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:13.39,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's not exactly a side, \Nbut I love pickled plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:12.18,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Lucky you, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.56,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,He accepts you for who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:18.64,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,You haven't had to deny yourself \Nyour favorite foods,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.43,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,fight your way into a glamorous club,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:23.51,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,or surround yourself with glamorous people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:28.80,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,You haven't had to put in \Nall that effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.67,0:06:35.41,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Sorry! A teacher asked me \Nto do something earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:39.95,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Can you two go ahead without me today? \NI might not make it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:40.83,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.48,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.68,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.57,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,The two of us, alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:51.72,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.64,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Their shoes have blue highlights, \Nso they must be third-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:58.03,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Isn't this the first-years' day \Nto use the gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:00.27,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,We can use the space over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.99,0:07:04.52,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Hey, you've gotten pretty good at returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.71,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Heh, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.15,DefaultTop,SHIBAMOTO,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:07.99,Default,SHIRAI,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.37,Default,SHIRAI,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're throwing it, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:21.85,Default,SHIBAMOTO,0,0,0,,My bad! It slipped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:25.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.07,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Us first-years have the gym today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:29.94,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.09,Default,SHIRAI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.18,Default,SHIBAMOTO,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:39.52,Default,SHIRAI,0,0,0,,Nothing. Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:46.70,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,It's back. I haven't had \Nthis feeling in a while. {/int}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:52.48,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Shirai! Shibamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:55.53,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,They're first-year girls! Shame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:56.51,Default,BOTH,0,0,0,,Ack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.89,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Get outta here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:07:59.91,Default,SHIRAI,0,0,0,,Our bad, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:02.93,Default,SHIBAMOTO,0,0,0,,We get it! Stop calling us out like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.20,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.59,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,That aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:15.47,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Shirai... Shibamoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:19.97,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,You know what? You two just made the list!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:22.52,Narration,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The List of Mika.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.51,Narration,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,A mental notepad that contains \Nthe names of every person
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:28.73,Narration,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,who dared to get on Egashira-san's bad side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:31.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yikes, that was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:33.57,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,People like that really exist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.57,0:08:35.10,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:37.27,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Don't put yourself in that kind of situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.76,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Next time, just tell a teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:41.04,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:44.48,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Putting guys like that on blast \Nis not the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.19,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,If they're scary, keep your distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:47.54,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:53.53,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But wasn't Fukuda-san cool? \NHe really told them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.80,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Huh? You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.19,0:08:59.60,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nah, I just got his name from his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.48,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hm? Egashira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:09.14,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,That's the difference between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.79,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,While I learn the names \Nof people who piss me off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:20.12,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Iwakura-san remembers the name \Nof someone who was kind to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.54,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Ah! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:28.85,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,I figured you were up to something\Nbecause you kept running off during lunch break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:30.67,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You've been practicing in secret, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:33.64,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,I picked volleyball too! \NYou could've invited me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.67,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.26,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,The truth is, I suck at sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:39.81,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah? We know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:43.73,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm not a stunning beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.73,DefaultTop,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,So? Gotten any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:47.50,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I think I've gotten used to \Nkeeping my eyes on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.50,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,or a pure, straightforward person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:54.60,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,Who in the world is ever going to choose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:59.19,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,One sec. I'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.19,0:10:00.47,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:02.77,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Murashige-san used to be \Non the volleyball team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:04.83,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,So why did you come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:09.21,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I guess I have always been nasty to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:11.69,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,So you didn't mind troubling me? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:14.59,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What? I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:24.60,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,W-Well, I did think you \Nwere a bit harsh at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:26.08,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But looking back...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.89,0:10:34.81,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You never lied to me. \NYou just didn't mince words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:41.23,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So I figured you wouldn't sugarcoat \Nthings with volleyball, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:46.75,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You know, there's more to teaching \Nthan simply answering questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:49.62,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And you did teach me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:56.69,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You've worked really hard to \Nget this good, and it shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:10.40,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Uh, you know I'm not praising \Nyour personality, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:12.69,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.48,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You've got a sharp tongue yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:18.97,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Sorry! I don't have my tracks with me \Ntoday, but I can do some light tosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:21.12,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I'm just here to heckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.07,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Can you come tomorrow too, Murashige-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:25.49,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:28.01,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Then help me teach Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:30.39,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Kurume-san, you take videos \Nand jot down notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:31.08,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:35.84,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Just so you know,\Nonce I get serious, that's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:38.76,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I only play to win, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.01,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:41.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.91,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What's going on? We doing \Na drill sergeant routine today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:46.72,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I wanted in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:49.22,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Done with your errand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:50.01,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:52.99,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,But it looks like you have enough help, \Nso maybe I'll head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:55.74,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,C-Come on, we don't have \Nmuch time! Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:56.97,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:11:59.31,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Egashira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:02.78,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:05.32,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,"You can do it"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:08.76,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:14.71,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,We'll work on your passing \Nbefore team practice begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:17.34,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Get your act together, Class Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.11,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.01,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:27.84,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Braiding complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:30.35,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,You look so cute, Makocchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.67,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:33.14,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:41.40,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Are you happy? Bet you are, \Nsince you're cuter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.65,0:12:43.96,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:44.92,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Ugh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:47.45,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,She can do that all by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:50.14,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm not saying you need to go that far...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:54.41,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,But that topknot is just not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:55.58,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.52,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It was my way of preparing \Nmyself for battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:02.00,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, it's way too uncool. \NDo you think you're home or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:04.55,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.58,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I want those hairpins back \Nwhen we're done, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mika-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:19.78,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:21.23,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:24.63,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Ooh, your forehead looks cute, Mitsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:26.57,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Heh-heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:29.44,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Today's class match day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.85,Default,GUYS,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.20,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.62,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:37.32,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:38.63,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.23,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:43.79,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:46.63,Default,UMP,0,0,0,,Game, set, and match!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:49.96,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Yay, we made it to the knockouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.17,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,We're doing great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:54.52,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Our weekend practices are paying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:56.14,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,Aim for gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.25,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:05.61,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,This is why I hate these \Nstupid class matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.32,Default,MITSUMIYUZUKI,0,0,0,,Don't mind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:12.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We'll avenge you, Makocchan. \NCome on, let's have lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:16.95,DefaultItalics,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,A few wins, and she thinks \Nshe's a volleyball pro now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:20.26,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,It's pretty boring when we're not playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.26,0:14:22.55,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,Let's go cheer on the others after we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:24.38,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I brought us all something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:28.01,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I made pickled veggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.14,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Wow, you made these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:32.02,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I figured we could use the sodium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:33.83,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,Digging in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:37.37,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I think I'll give some to \NShima-kun and the team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.55,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We're going to go watch \Nthe basketball, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:41.90,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:45.26,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I don't know if you'll be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:52.48,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Check this out, Mukai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:56.49,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Apparently, guys are thirty percent \Ncooler when playing sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:57.75,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.50,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Time to line up. Let's kick their butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.50,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.25,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,She may be here right now... {this is not meant to be internal because tsukasa actually responds to it}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:08.46,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,My future love, my amore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:10.66,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Good luck, Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.51,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,Hope springs eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.94,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wow, so many people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:18.42,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm guessing most of them \Nare here for Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:21.25,Default,GIRLA,0,0,0,,Is Number 5 Shima-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:23.73,Default,GIRLB,0,0,0,,Wow, he really is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:25.35,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Even the upperclassmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.45,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Nice one, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.12,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:40.33,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Let's gooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.68,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,He could have taken that shot himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:44.96,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,The other team is all newbies,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:48.21,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,so he took a step back \Nto let his friend shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.50,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Let's get another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:51.30,Default,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Squee! He's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.18,DefaultItalics,YUZUKIMAKOTO,0,0,0,,The rich get richer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:55.34,DefaultTop,GIRL,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:58.34,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun really is popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.34,DefaultTop,GIRL,0,0,0,,Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:03.94,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Not that I didn't know, but it really \Nshows during an event like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.89,Default,REF,0,0,0,,Class 3 wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.76,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Aren't you giving them to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:22.32,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nah! I can't really go talk \Nto him right now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I wonder where Yuzu-chan and Makocchan are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:28.45,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,I guess even Mitsumi can read this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:33.17,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, wanna head back? \NOur next match is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:36.67,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Shima's a good guy, so why \Ndo I feel so empty inside?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:37.54,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.22,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Great shot. That was really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:45.47,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Viva class matches!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:47.02,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,Happy for you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.35,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,Huh, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:50.33,Default,TSUKASA,0,0,0,,Sousuke should be—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:52.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's fine. I only came to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:03.80,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, no way she could give \Nanything to him back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:08.00,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,If she'd even talked to him, the other girls \Nwould've been like, "Who the hell is she?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:13.15,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Yeah, and then they would've gone, \N"She even brought him something! No way!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:16.09,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Y-You thought so, too? Close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:19.00,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Is Shima-kun that popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:22.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Crazy, huh? It's still only June...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:24.31,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Kanechika-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:25.67,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.15,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Hello, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:30.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Uh, which sport are you \Nparticipating in, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:31.38,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:35.45,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But I'm just a sub, so I was making \Nrice balls up in the Home Ec. room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:39.62,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I'll never be useful in anything physical, \Nno matter how hard I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:44.50,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,So I'm focusing on looking after the team's \Nenergy levels and conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.33,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,They're freshly made, \Nso all of you, have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:49.63,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I used plastic wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:54.27,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Never thought about offering \Nthe whole team the pickles, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.63,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:57.97,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Let's sit down there and eat these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:18:00.42,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, then we can eat these too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:03.05,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun must be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:03.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:08.48,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Well, I've never been popular, \Nso I'm just guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.86,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,He may act the same as he always does,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:14.07,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,but maybe people tend to \Nkeep their distance from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.28,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Lonely? Who, Shima-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:25.16,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,He's the first friend I made in Tokyo, \Nand I see him as a really good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:29.69,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But part of me was afraid he \Ndidn't see me the same way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:35.16,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and assumed I was the lonely one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:41.77,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Why did he ask me to be \Nhis friend in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:48.06,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Th-They're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:53.06,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,They have someone who made starter on \Nthe volleyball team as a first-year! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:57.69,Default,ACE,0,0,0,,Heh-heh. It's my serve now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:06.66,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.56,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You're targeting a newbie with jump serves?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.67,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,That's dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:12.96,Default,ACE,0,0,0,,Shaddup! All's fair in sport and war!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.69,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,She's planning to finish \Nthe game off with her serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:19.33,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Mitsumi! We'll do \Nour best to scoop up your receives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:21.09,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:24.36,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You practiced so much! You can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:29.35,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:35.02,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I was going full-tilt on the day \Nof the entrance ceremony, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.55,0:19:49.20,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So much so that I was just \Nrunning around in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:53.96,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I probably was a huge bother \Nto Shima-kun on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:58.18,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I was "the puker," but he paid it no mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:00.93,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and reached out to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:22.30,Default,GUYS,0,0,0,,Whoa! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:30.58,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Second place...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:32.78,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:37.32,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,But it was so much fun. We did our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:38.58,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:41.46,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,Looks like the boys made \Nthe final in basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:43.18,Default,KAWATANI,0,0,0,,It's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:48.23,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm going to run there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:50.38,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I couldn't focus on \Ncheering for them earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.43,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And I'm going to hand these over, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:55.44,Default,JOUNAI,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:57.70,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,She's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:21:01.20,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,I'm kinda envious that she can \Nultimately make that choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:07.41,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Why does it sound like you like \NShima-kun too, Egashira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:09.11,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:12.35,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Sure, I think he's hot, but so do you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:16.21,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Besides, we've only been going\Nto school together for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:22.06,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Well, even Mitsumi only has \N"We're just friends" vibes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.28,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,They're so tight, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.95,Default,YUMIDA,0,0,0,,Let's go cheer them on, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.86,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,They're not wrong, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:32.17,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,When you fall in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.97,0:21:36.19,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,sometimes it's because you find \Nsomething in them that you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.90,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Give 'em hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:44.64,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,And maybe, just maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.49,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,whatever it is Shima-kun wishes he had...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:50.54,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:54.36,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,You're awesome, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:57.60,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,She might just have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:03.38,DefaultItalics,MIKA,0,0,0,,That's the feeling I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:07.25,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.53,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Pickled veggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.01,0:22:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,

